# Abelian varieties

The abelian-variety input to the curve estimates and the trace formula: the theorem of
the cube, rigidity, the multiplication-by-`n` isogeny, étale `n`-torsion and
divisibility, and the `ℓ`-adic Tate module. The Jacobian itself is constructed in
`WeilConjectures.Blueprint.PicardFramework`.

Blueprint block `sec-abelian-varieties`.
